<https://dgg32.github.io/glp/ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A small OWL ontology for US Medicare Part D prescribing of type 2 diabetes drugs: who prescribes which product, containing which substance, in which therapeutic class. Product and substance classes are aligned to IDMP-O 1.4.0; commercial concepts (prescriber, prescription aggregate) are not covered by IDMP-O and are defined here."@en .
