<https://dgg32.github.io/glp/ontology#Prescription> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The total Part D claims, fills, days of supply, cost and beneficiaries of one healthcare professional for one medicinal product in one data year. One row of the CMS 'Prescribers by Provider and Drug' dataset."@en .
<https://dgg32.github.io/glp/ontology#HealthcareProfessional> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An individual (NPI type 1) who prescribes drugs reimbursed under Medicare Part D."@en .
